      "policy_quote": "Modify items in a pending order to new items of the same product but of different product option. There cannot be any change of product types, e.g., modify shirt to shoe.",
      "requirement": "The new item must belong to the same product type as the original item (e.g., backpack must remain a backpack)."
    },
