      "policy_quote": "This action can only be called once, and will change the order status to 'pending (items modified).' The agent will not be able to modify or cancel the order anymore.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure this is the only modification action taken for this order, as subsequent modifications or cancellations will be prohibited."
